# Trackora Roadmap

This roadmap communicates the direction of Trackora. Priorities and timelines may change as development progresses and feedback is collected.

## Core asset management
- [ ] Asset registration and inventory management
- [ ] Asset categories, locations, and status tracking
- [ ] Assignment, return, and transfer workflows
- [ ] Search, filtering, and asset details

## Lifecycle and operations
- [ ] Maintenance and warranty tracking
- [ ] QR labels and physical inventory workflows
- [ ] Asset history and lifecycle management
- [ ] Reporting and inventory audits

## Advanced capabilities
- [ ] Software and license management
- [ ] Asset analytics and cost visibility
- [ ] AI-assisted asset information retrieval

## SaaS foundation
- [ ] Organizational workspaces and role-based permissions
- [ ] Tenant isolation and security testing
- [ ] Subscription plans and usage controls

## Help shape Trackora

Have a suggestion? Open an issue and describe the problem you want Trackora to solve.

**Note:** This roadmap describes planned product direction, not a guarantee that every feature is implemented or scheduled for a particular release.
